# Short links for bios and pinned comments (P5), read by Cloudflare Pages; GitHub Pages ignores this
# file. Static rules only (2,000 allowed, no Functions), so a surge costs nothing. The ref lands in
# the `open` event. A creator's own link, /c/<handle>, needs no rule: Pages serves the game for a
# path it has no file for, and src/boot.ts turns /c/<handle> into ref=c-<handle> (a _redirects
# placeholder is not substituted inside a query string).
/tt   /?ref=tt   302
/ig   /?ref=ig   302
/yt   /?ref=yt   302
/x    /?ref=x    302
/r    /?ref=r    302
